The encoding index tables in encoding_tables.h are generated from the WHATWG
Encoding Standard's machine-readable index data:

    https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/indexes.json

That data is Copyright WHATWG (Apple, Google, Mozilla, Microsoft) and is
licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License:

