Regenerate with:

    python3 scripts/generate_encoding_tables.py third_party/whatwg-encoding/encoding_tables.h

The generator pins the SHA-256 of the upstream data and refuses to write when
it changes, so an upstream revision is an explicit decision rather than a
silent behavior change.
